        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    open_prices = [150, 152, 153, 151, 152, 150, 149, 151, 150, 148, 147, 146, 148, 149, 147]\n    close_prices = [152, 150, 152, 153, 151, 152, 150, 149, 151, 150, 149, 148, 146, 147, 148]\n    period = 14\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    gains = [max(close_prices[i] - open_prices[i], 0) for i in range(1, len(open_prices))]\n    losses = [max(open_prices[i] - close_prices[i], 0) for i in range(1, len(open_prices))]\n    total_gains = sum(gains[-period:])\n    total_losses = sum(losses[-period:])\n    answer = round(total_gains / (total_gains + total_losses) * 100, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
